<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela H.L. Boulton Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Venezuela H.L. Boulton Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		    1996</p>
<p>    Net profit	 1.56 bln bolivars  loss 1.49 bln</p>
<p>    Revenues	  10.29 bln bolivars	 9.48 bln</p>
<p>    Total costs	8.73 bln bolivars	10.95 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Period ended March 31. All results are expressed in constant March 31, 1997 bolivars.</p>
<p>H.L. Boulton &amp; Co SACA is a holding company.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
